dialogs
0	I'm the MOVE TUTOR.I know all the moves that POKéMON learn--every one of them--and I can teach POKéMON those moves.I can teach a move to a POKéMON of yours if you'd like.I'll do it for a HEART SCALE. I'm collecting those now.
